      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cronulla",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Surveyor Robert Dixon recorded the expansive beach as Cronulla in 1827, and the main beach was still called Karranulla by 1840.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
